1687 0 obj
<<
/Title (To design and implement a hybrid retrieval pipeline combining local intent parsing \(Phi-3 Mini\), semantic embeddings, and keyword-based matching capable of surfacing the correct file within the top-3 results for at least 85% of natural-language queries, tested on a corpus of 150+ mixed PDF/DOCX/TXT files. This directly targets the narrow, closed-set intent-classification limitation.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1672 0 R
/Next 1698 0 R
>>
endobj
1688 0 obj
<<
/Title (To empirically benchmark the hybrid, reranked pipeline against a plain keyword search and a dense-only semantic search on the same test set, so that the improvement from each added component \(hybrid retrieval, reranking\) is quantified rather than assumed.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1672 0 R
/Prev 1699 0 R
>>
endobj
